# TrustIoT gateway image (edge/image, Laysi/trustiot-v2#810): the data partition, unlocked at boot
# by this gateway's TPM alone (edge/image/README.md, section 「資料分割區加密」). headless: never ask
# for a password; nofail: a volume that does not unlock leaves the gateway booting and reachable,
# with the data partition unmounted and the agent stopped. x-systemd.device-timeout: the volume
# appears only when the first boot's setup has encrypted the partition, which can take longer
# than systemd's default 90 s for a nofail entry; the generator turns it into the device's job
# timeout and does not pass it to systemd-cryptsetup.
trustiot_data UUID=9da7f680-5912-4d5c-bca6-d46c83e064f8 none luks,tpm2-device=auto,headless=true,nofail,x-systemd.device-timeout=15min
